                                                "sense_id": "9b1f9b5d-56a0-35af-977b-50b2e0b74037",
                                                "text": "Forty minutes later, we found ourselves seated on boulders on the side of Kuan Yin Shan with a lovely view of the river and the town of Tamsui to the east and the farms and field of Pali to the north."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fcd9e3ef-779d-41f8-8185-1dee477c357b",
                                                "sense_id": "9b1f9b5d-56a0-35af-977b-50b2e0b74037",
                                                "text": "He roused Max from his Taipei hotel suite to tell him the change in plans and to meet the Oregon at the Bali District piers the following day."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "db6592bf-6b6c-4172-a0e3-14ef0687b234",
                                                "sense_id": "9b1f9b5d-56a0-35af-977b-50b2e0b74037",
                                                "text": "New Taipei City’s Bali District (八里, across the river from Tamsui) isn’t a place that immediately springs to mind for tourist attractions."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
